  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Nullflame.Runtime::Nullflame.HintPresenter
  entity: {fileID: 1552938427}
  jump: {fileID: 1552938426}
  consume: {fileID: 1552938431}
  timePowers: {fileID: 1552938432}
  label: {fileID: 1662928294}
  showTime: 5
  texts:
  - W/A/S/D to slide within your shadow. Move the mouse to look.
  - Aim at a shadow and left-click to jump to it.
  - Hold E to consume the owner of this shadow.
  - Hold R while riding a guard to reverse their time.
  - Hold Q to rewind the facility.
  - Hold E to crack the pipe. Release in the green.
